WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
- The first album you
bought was Britney Spears.

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:02.773
Is that true?

00:00:02.773 --> 00:00:03.606
- Yes.
(audience cheers)

00:00:03.606 --> 00:00:04.708
- Which one?

00:00:04.708 --> 00:00:06.247
- 'Baby One More Time-'
- [Kelly] Okay, okay.

00:00:06.247 --> 00:00:08.490
- Was the very first CD like, of mine.

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:10.920
That I owned, that was
like, very much mine.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:14.261
And I ended up working
with her, which is crazy.

00:00:14.261 --> 00:00:15.810
Crazy.
(audience cheers)

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.300
- What did y'all work on together?

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.775
- So I was, I was a
feature on one of her songs

00:00:19.775 --> 00:00:22.724
on her album. It was
called "Slumber Party."

00:00:22.724 --> 00:00:23.557
- [Kelly] Yeah.
(audience cheers)

00:00:23.557 --> 00:00:26.000
- [Tinashe] I'm telling you it was-

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.250
- [Kelly] Look at you smile-

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.930
- [Tinashe] Cause I was like in, in heaven

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.578
it still feels really
surreal just to be able to

00:00:31.578 --> 00:00:32.770
work with somebody that

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.888
you know, you've idolized
your entire life was

00:00:34.888 --> 00:00:37.480
was really, really, really crazy.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.420
Still to this day, I'm like,

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.702
'I can't believe that happened.'

00:00:39.702 --> 00:00:41.164
- She's super sweet too.

00:00:41.164 --> 00:00:42.350
- She's so sweet.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.183
- So kind.

00:00:43.183 --> 00:00:44.490
- She's so nice to meet her in real life.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.820
- I know it's always
nice when you see someone

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.110
that's blown up so big
but they're still like,

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.080
very like humble and sweet in person.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:49.930
- Yeah. Totally authentic.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.350
Like she's Britney 100%.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.830
And to see her star
power on stage as well.

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:55.510
Like, when you're actually
on the stage with her

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:56.853
like filming a music video
with her, the camera's rolling.

00:00:56.853 --> 00:00:58.020
- Do you feel it?

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.936
- You just see like, that character

00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:01.230
come outta her and you're like,

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:02.654
'oh wow. That's Britney Spears.'

00:01:02.654 --> 00:01:03.537
(laughs)

00:01:03.537 --> 00:01:05.570
- But like, you're that
person now too though.

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:09.000
- [Tinashe] Well you know-
(audience cheers)

